              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona kïnam malaykayantanay rotwenyi akïmutï akwa sapipun, akïwirchï chane wölo kïpïro dipaypa nörekyo Tororöt. ",
          "type": "text",
